session Semicontinuous_Analysis = "HOL-Probability" +
  description "
    Upper and lower semicontinuity that is not about any particular
    function: the epsilon-delta calculus, semicontinuous envelopes over the
    whole space or relative to a closed set, Berge's maximum theorem, and a
    measurable selection theorem for upper semicontinuous payoffs on
    compact sets.
  "
  sessions
    Standard_Borel_Spaces
  theories
    Semicontinuity
    Semicontinuous_Envelopes
    Berge
    Semicontinuous_Selection
  document_files
    "root.tex"
    "root.bib"
